ā.\n[]", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "सोमेश्वर pupil of Yogeśvarācārya:\n Śrutaśabdārthasamuccaya.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "C. on Bhojarāja's Siddhāntasaṃgraha.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "सोमेश्वर son of Mādhava Bhaṭṭa:\n Nyāyasudhā or Rāṇaka or Sarvānavadyakāriṇī,\na C. on the Tantravārttika of Kumārila.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "सोमेश्वर of Bhojapura, father of Keśava (Kauśikagṛhya-\npaddhati).", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Kāvyaprakāśaṭīkā Kāvyādarśa.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["सोमेश्वरः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["someSvaraH"]}], "somesvaradeva": [{"id": "someSvaradeva", "headword": "सोमेश्वरदेव", "headword_slp1": "someSvaradeva", "fold": "somesvaradeva", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "Karuṇāmṛtaprabhāsubhāṣitāvalī.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Rāmāyaṇanāṭaka.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "सोमेश्वरदेव purohita to Bhīmadeva of Aṇahillapāṭaka,\nand Lavaṇaprasāda of Dholkā, client of the ministers\nVastupāla and his brother Tejaḥpāla. He was the\nson of Kumāra, son of Āmaśarman, son of Soma,\nson of Muñja, son of Lallaśarman, son of Sola\n(under Mūlarājadeva). His Praśastis on mount Abu\nare dated 1232--52:\n Kāvyaprakāśaṭīkā.\n Kāvyādarśa.\n Kīrtikaumudī.\n Rāmaśataka.\n Surathotsava.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "somotpati": [{"id": "somotpatti", "headword": "सोमोत्पत्ति", "headword_slp1": "somotpatti", "fold": "somotpati", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "सोमोत्पत्ति vaid. Oxf. 398^b. K. 12. Kh. 59. 63. B.\n1, 194. P. 7. Oppert 4468.\n --a Pariśiṣṭa of the Sv. W. p. 78. Oxf. 383^b. L.\n1589. Peters. 2, 180.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "सोमोत्पत्ति vaid. Gov. Or. Libr. Madras 110.\n --a Pariśiṣṭa of the Sv. Peters. 4, 5.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "सोमोत्पत्ति Sv. Ulwar 284.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "somadevasuri": [{"id": "somadevasUri", "hea